    "pricing": {
      "type": "bpm-sites-pricing-breakdown",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "TRANSPARENT PRICING",
        "heading": "No green tax.\nNo mystery markup.",
        "body": "<p>No green tax or mystery markup. A transparent look at where your money goes.</p><p>We price BPM at $23.99 to cover what it takes to make the product properly, package it responsibly, ship it thoughtfully, support discounts, give back, and keep BPM running. We keep pricing consistent across our website and Amazon, even though Amazon takes a larger share through fulfilment, fees, advertising, and freight. Buying directly from BPM keeps more of each sale with us, which means more can go back into the product, the company, and charitable causes. Fair, transparent pricing. No hidden markups. Costs shown are estimates and may vary slightly over time.</p>",
